WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.247
This is how AgentOS goes onto your own Linux
server, step by step.

2
00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:15.496
After your order, we hand you the Agency
Package. It is one folder with the install
script, two ready-made agents and demo data.
Copy it to your server and open a terminal
there.

3
00:00:16.296 --> 00:00:26.002
You need a Linux server with Python 3.12 or
newer. Systemd user services are used for
the schedules. Check your version with one
command before you go on.

4
00:00:26.802 --> 00:00:36.276
Run the install script with the dry run
flag. It prints every step it would take,
and writes nothing to your disk. Read the
list, so you know exactly what will happen.

5
00:00:37.076 --> 00:00:46.596
When the preview looks right, run the same
command without the dry run flag. The script
creates the folders, a Python environment,
and the daily and weekly schedules.

6
00:00:47.396 --> 00:00:54.548
Now open the AgentOS panel in your browser.
This is where you watch your agents work and
see what they have done, all from one
screen.

7
00:00:55.348 --> 00:01:05.100
The package ships with two ready agents.
Lead Triage sorts your incoming leads.
Client Reporting builds your client reports.
Start with one, and check its result.

8
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:11.055
Done. Need help? Email
support@ironvisiontools.com.
